# Generated by `just typescript-grammar` from upstream tree-sitter-typescript and never edited by
# hand. The two `parser.c` files are 8 MB each, so they are left out of diffs; `grammar.json` and
# `node-types.json` stay diffable, because that is where a regeneration's change can be read.
crates/lanekeep-tree-sitter-typescript/typescript/src/** linguist-generated=true
crates/lanekeep-tree-sitter-typescript/tsx/src/** linguist-generated=true
crates/lanekeep-tree-sitter-typescript/*/src/parser.c -diff
# Byte-for-byte on every platform: `grammar/digests.txt` and the crate's source digest hash these
# files, and a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf` would otherwise hand them CRLF line endings.
crates/lanekeep-tree-sitter-typescript/** -text
